Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Page-guard suite: the bare project URL is the overview;
 the editor is ?tab=

blocker-fixes-test R3 fetched /studio/<id> expecting the questionnaire in
the server HTML. Since the overview landing (058da08) the bare URL is the
overview shell, which carries no definition; the editor with the definition
is the ?tab= URL. The check now covers both: a member gets the overview
shell (no question text in it) and the editor at ?tab=questions (with it);
a stranger is told "not found" on both URLs and sees neither the question
nor the option labels. 30/30. The report records the full browser-corpus
result (128/137; the 9 failures are the known baseline set).

